      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The controller's `/metrics` exposes **no** object-storage (MinIO) queue metrics yet. MinIO's own `/minio/v2/metrics/cluster` can be added as a scrape job (bearer token from `mc admin prometheus generate`); see docs/MONITORING.md."
      }
